        "type": "writing",
        "title": "With growing number of population in cities, many people are living in small homes that don't have outdoor spaces. Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-53467981-7fff-8ac0-e893-9da20a06de09\">With growing number of population in cities, many people are living in small homes that don't have outdoor spaces. Is this a positive or negative development?</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Small City Homes&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Small City Homes&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Với sự gia tăng d&acirc;n số ở c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố, nhiều người đang sống trong những ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nhỏ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng gian ngo&agrave;i trời.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Small City Homes&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMbvd0hgKofDmuxvMDElbqfmgBe\" data-list=\"bullet\">rapid population growth <em>(sự gia tăng d&acirc;n số nhanh ch&oacute;ng)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực hơn l&agrave; t&iacute;ch cực.&nbsp;</strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực của việc sống trong nh&agrave; nhỏ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng gian ngo&agrave;i trời đối với cư d&acirc;n đ&ocirc; thị.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực của việc sống trong nh&agrave; nhỏ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng gian ngo&agrave;i trời.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6DFdb7UeoXdCaxuQSBlQa9Ogqe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, những ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nhỏ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng gian ngo&agrave;i trời c&oacute; thể mang lại một số lợi &iacute;ch cho người d&acirc;n đ&ocirc; thị.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZcKdzjBwoBusIxbaEIlhfDYgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVo7dxNVLocvDlxCCqHlH0RLgJe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Về khả năng chi trả, <em>những kh&ocirc;ng gian sống nhỏ gọn (compact living spaces) </em>n&agrave;y c&oacute; chi ph&iacute; thấp hơn một ch&uacute;t d&agrave;nh cho cư d&acirc;n v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng đ&ograve;i hỏi &iacute;t<em> vốn đầu tư ban đầu (initial investment)</em> hơn để mua hoặc thu&ecirc;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KjNqdxKIeoxtmTxENlElmNIhgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-fa17f3ae-7fff-64a9-7c9a-c4955dee3bf5\">Example:</strong> những ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nhỏ hơn c&oacute; thể dẫn đến việc <em>giảm h&oacute;a đơn tiện &iacute;ch (reduce utility bills)</em> v&igrave; cần &iacute;t năng lượng hơn cho việc sưởi ấm, l&agrave;m m&aacute;t v&agrave; chiếu s&aacute;ng.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmJ7d25upop9tUxS1JAllTohgNg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiG4de0dzof40cx8fEdls7wagFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: <em>Nh&agrave; ở mật độ cao với c&aacute;c tiện nghi được chia sẻ (high-density housing with shared facilities)</em> c&oacute; tiềm năng <em>th&uacute;c đẩy mối quan hệ cộng đồng (foster community bonds)</em> giữa những người h&agrave;ng x&oacute;m.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RHQxdyZRYoZpU6x5wBXlPX4Egag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> khi cư d&acirc;n chia sẻ c&aacute;c khu vực chung như vườn hoặc<em> kh&ocirc;ng gian giải tr&iacute; trong c&aacute;c khu chung cư (recreational spaces in apartment complexes)</em>, họ c&oacute; nhiều cơ hội tương t&aacute;c với nhau hơn, từ đ&oacute; <em>tạo dựng c&aacute;c mạng lưới gi&uacute;p đỡ nhau c&oacute; gi&aacute; trị (create valuable support networks)</em> gi&uacute;p chống lại sự c&ocirc; lập thường gặp ở c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố lớn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra.</span><br></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TxrhdY5gSooM4IxJahHlrGSjgkb\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những lợi thế n&agrave;y bị lu mờ bởi những bất lợi.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXfqdgollov4jlxHOMxlUAIWgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLq3d1hzxo3YIKx4veAlKwGGgAe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Vấn đề đ&aacute;ng lo ngại nhất l&agrave; chất lượng cuộc sống giảm s&uacute;t do kh&ocirc;ng gian sống hạn chế</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JvBwdxmT8otPaSx1tbjlU9OPg0g\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Example:</strong> cư d&acirc;n thường phải đối mặt với sự <em>thiếu ri&ecirc;ng tư (inadequate privacy)</em>, khiến việc tổ chức những hoạt động c&oacute; tầm quan trọng về mặt văn h&oacute;a ở một số quốc gia như &nbsp;<em>tiếp đ&oacute;n kh&aacute;ch (accommodate guests)</em> hoặc<em> tổ chức c&aacute;c cuộc gặp mặt gia đ&igrave;nh (host family gatherings)</em> trở n&ecirc;n kh&oacute; khăn. B&ecirc;n cạnh đ&oacute;, việc thiếu kh&ocirc;ng gian lưu trữ cũng dẫn đến <em>m&ocirc;i trường lộn xộn (cluttered environments)</em>, c&oacute; thể l&agrave;m tăng mức độ căng thẳng.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BaPNd6J5Gol93zx83BDlouuwgQd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoRbdJnEAoSg4ZxUhf5lv8Csg1w\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>:&nbsp;Kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng gian ngo&agrave;i trời, mọi người c&oacute; &iacute;t cơ hội hơn đ&aacute;ng kể cho c&aacute;c hoạt động thể chất, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể khiến trẻ em từ những gia đ&igrave;nh như vậy kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; nơi an to&agrave;n để chơi b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i, trong khi người lớn c&oacute; <em>c&aacute;c lựa chọn hạn chế để tập thể dục v&agrave; giải tr&iacute; (limited options for exercise and recreation)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ook9dJrvoo3cWHxifVXlVD0ogyh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact: </strong>&nbsp;Hậu quả l&agrave;, hạn chế n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể dẫn đến<em> lối sống &iacute;t vận động hơn (sedentary lifestyles)</em>, từ đ&oacute; c&oacute; khả năng g&acirc;y ra c&aacute;c vấn đề sức khỏe nghi&ecirc;m trọng như b&eacute;o ph&igrave; v&agrave; c&aacute;c t&igrave;nh trạng li&ecirc;n quan trong d&agrave;i hạn.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LuP6d7JcNomKxzxUlHJlThqKgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LMOGdUKHBoxVn6xhLKElAVMOgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">promote community interaction<em> (th&uacute;c đẩy tương t&aacute;c cộng đồng)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LMOGdUKHBoxVn6xhLKElAVMOgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">incorporate green spaces<em> (t&iacute;ch hợp kh&ocirc;ng gian xanh)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LMOGdUKHBoxVn6xhLKElAVMOgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">develop urban housing<em> (quy hoạch nh&agrave; ở đ&ocirc; thị)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1067,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>Opinions are divided on whether the rapid population growth in many cities has led to an increasing number of people living in small homes without outdoor spaces. Although this situation offers certain advantages in terms of cost and community development, I believe it brings more significant negative impacts on people's quality of life.</p>",
            "question_id": 16533,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1068,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-2a29ec24-7fff-96e7-7fe8-7f4e806ea5f1\">Admittedly, small homes without outdoor areas could provide some benefits to urban dwellers. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Regarding affordability, these compact living spaces are more cost-effective for residents as they require lower initial investment to purchase or rent, especially for young workers in major cities like Ho Chi Minh City or Hanoi. In this regard, smaller homes might lead to reduced utility bills since less energy is needed for heating, cooling, and lighting. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, high-density housing with shared facilities can foster community bonds among neighbors. When residents share common areas such as gardens or recreational spaces in apartment complexes, they have more opportunities to interact with each other, thus creating valuable support networks that could counteract the isolation often experienced in big cities.</span></span></p>",
            "question_id": 16533,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1069,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I believe these advantages are outweighed by the drawbacks. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The most concerning issue is the reduced quality of life that comes with limited living space. For example, residents often struggle with inadequate privacy and personal space, making it difficult to accommodate guests or host family gatherings, which are culturally important activities in some countries. Additionally, the lack of storage also leads to cluttered environments, which can increase stress levels. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Moreover, without outdoor spaces, people have significantly fewer opportunities for physical activities, which can cause children from such families to have no safe places to play outside, while adults have limited options for exercise and recreation. As a consequence, this constraint can further result in more sedentary lifestyles, thereby potentially causing serious health problems like obesity and related conditions in the long term.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 16533,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1070,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while small homes without outdoor spaces offer economic benefits and can promote community interaction, I believe their negative impacts on living quality and physical well-being are more significant. City planners should prioritize incorporating green spaces and recreational areas when developing urban housing.</p>",
            "question_id": 16533,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
